  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "be9f73c4c85594b1ff378ddb98a310825f46c8c6e2aa550cc122481ccd4bcdcb",
      "text": "悟空的\n热闹午觉",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "732d9833ada2bf1dfc4191ff1a05b21ee59739810310b83f4a57a03571e41571",
      "text": "悟空打了个大哈欠。\n“该睡午觉啦！”\n他来到桃树下，凉快极了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c1b06d1ade4a84dacbaa30c9968e49c298fb8e5dac535fb7a93f225d745e935c",
      "text": "八戒抱来一个枕头。\n“像云朵一样软！”\n接着，他的肚子\n咕噜咕噜叫。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cee2ec1d90037526c6728a85415b9e555e7d057613ef7ddb43adb0167df85d0b",
      "text": "“先吃点心吧。”悟空说。\n吧唧，吧唧。\n八戒的肚子安静啦。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a592f8026e8f03efaac6b881493e993bfb0239c32b42c8b8cd71b375466c16b8",
      "text": "沙僧拿着大叶子，\n慢慢地扇呀扇。\n叶子蹭到了悟空的鼻子。\n“啊……啊……阿嚏！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9789e30ecc1345d4792c418b8ecdc7b2812513659ff033bb859fced8051ae401",
      "text": "一只小鸟唱起歌。\n“啾啾！啾啾！”\n悟空坐了起来。\n“小声一点，好吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8213048cf8be16cf16c52b057485823d037ea49d9e3725d2b8a71cf08e779e2f",
      "text": "八戒轻轻地嚼，\n沙僧慢慢地扇，\n小鸟小声唱：“啾……啾……”\n悟空笑了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "16608eee7163ac7fb3098945e17d2f32c5f38757d4931fb18cc922a486728b85",
      "text": "悟空轻轻吹了一口气。\n一朵小云\n绕着他的脚转圈。\n“刚刚好。”他悄悄说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4e673d8c1c127a1c87cd3a2fda82101b36997cd717cb2b82f23eeeb86f0d771b",
      "text": "很快，朋友们也困了。\n八戒打起呼噜：“呼噜……”\n悟空忍不住又笑了一声。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2d5320d09aca72475d5610c8f13f7ce4a2d82e026aa536bf29ad4753595f48fc",
      "text": "桃树下，\n大家都睡着了。\n树叶沙沙轻响，\n云朵慢慢飘过。\n英雄也需要午睡呀。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec8d2925b34f65683b4ac3a96f4d0a62c5669ce90c16387e750248f64252ac20",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n故事与插画使用 AI 辅助创作，由作者指导和编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
